&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2015, Mejuri has reimagined what fine jewelry can be in a modern world—shifting it from a traditional gift to to a personal choice rooted in self-expression.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded by third-generation jeweller Noura Sakkijha, the brand was built on a simple idea: fine jewelry shouldn’t require a special occasion, and it should never come with guilt. It’s about celebrating yourself—your style, your life, your everyday.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mejuri meets customers where they are—online, in app, and through a growing global retail footprint of 58+ stores worldwide. Mejuri is also deeply committed to doing things the right way, with responsible sourcing, sustainable practices, and philanthropic initiatives that reflect our values and long-term vision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Payroll Specialist accountable for the accurate, timely processing of semi-monthly payroll for approximately 400 Canadian employees across multiple provinces. This includes validating timesheets and employee changes before every run, calculating off-cycle payments and manual cheques, and ensuring statutory deductions, benefits, and garnishments are processed correctly each cycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Senior Manager, Payroll, you&#39;re the first point of contact for employees with questions about pay, deductions, or tax matters, and you&#39;ll partner with People &amp;amp; Culture to keep employee data consistent across systems and with Finance on reconciliation, month-end, and year-end close, including T4 preparation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;15:1-15:23;1232-1254&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Payroll Processing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;17:1-20:141;1256-1830&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;17:1-17:164;1256-1419&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run semi-monthly payroll&lt;/strong&gt; — Process payroll for approximately 400 Canadian employees across multiple provinces in ADP Workforce Now, every cycle, on schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;18:1-18:147;1420-1566&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Validate inputs before each run&lt;/strong&gt; — Review timesheets, new hires, terminations, and employee changes for accuracy before payroll is submitted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;19:1-19:123;1567-1689&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Handle off-cycle payments&lt;/strong&gt; — Calculate and issue off-cycle payments, adjustments, and manual cheques as they come up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;20:1-20:141;1690-1830&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply deductions correctly&lt;/strong&gt; — Process statutory deductions, benefits, garnishments, and other payroll deductions accurately each cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;22:1-22:27;1832-1858&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;24:1-27:112;1860-2373&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;24:1-24:172;1860-2031&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain compliant records&lt;/strong&gt; — Keep payroll records current and aligned with federal and provincial employment standards legislation across every province you process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;25:1-25:117;2032-2148&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reconcile each cycle&lt;/strong&gt; — Reconcile payroll reports every pay period and flag discrepancies before they compound.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;26:1-26:113;2149-2261&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close month-end and year-end&lt;/strong&gt; — Support month-end and year-end payroll processes, including T4 preparation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;27:1-27:112;2262-2373&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support audits&lt;/strong&gt; — Provide payroll documentation and reports for internal and external audits as requested.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;29:1-29:30;2375-2404&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnership &amp;amp; Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;31:1-34:107;2406-2882&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;31:1-31:109;2406-2514&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resolve employee questions&lt;/strong&gt; — Respond to pay, deduction, and tax inquiries promptly and professionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;32:1-32:134;2515-2648&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep data aligned across systems&lt;/strong&gt; — Partner with People &amp;amp; Culture and Finance so payroll data is consistent everywhere it lives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;33:1-33:127;2649-2775&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve how payroll runs&lt;/strong&gt; — Identify process gaps and contribute to documentation that makes the function more resilient.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;34:1-34:107;2776-2882&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support global payroll&lt;/strong&gt; — Assist with US, UK, and Australia payroll processing or projects as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;38:1-38:111;2906-3016&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Payroll processing experience&lt;/strong&gt; — 2-3 years processing payroll in a multi-provincial Canadian environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;39:1-39:96;3017-3112&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADP Workforce Now proficiency&lt;/strong&gt; — Hands-on experience running payroll in ADP Workforce Now.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;40:1-40:215;3113-3327&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Canadian payroll knowledge&lt;/strong&gt; — Solid understanding of statutory deductions, employment standards, and payroll legislation across provinces; PCP certification (or in progress) and US payroll exposure are assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;41:1-41:125;3328-3452&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accuracy under pressure&lt;/strong&gt; — A track record of maintaining accuracy while handling sensitive, confidential employee data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;42:1-42:121;3453-3573&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organizational discipline&lt;/strong&gt; — Experience managing multiple payroll deadlines simultaneously without missing a cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;43:1-43:107;3574-3680&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communication&lt;/strong&gt; — Comfortable explaining pay, deductions, and tax matters directly to employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;44:1-44:106;3681-3786&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excel fluency&lt;/strong&gt; — Comfortable working with large data sets in Excel for reconciliation and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re building an AI-fluent organization. We welcome candidates at all stages of their AI journey — what matters is curiosity, a willingness to learn, and an openness to working alongside AI tools as part of how we do our best work.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Benefits at Mejuri:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of four weeks vacation, plus personal days and three religious/cultural observance days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hybrid work model for all corporate roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;‘Mejuri Passport’ which allows employees who meet specific criteria to work in other locations for one month per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive medical and dental benefits, including mental health coverage, and generous personal and sick days for our full-time employees. We also offer bereavement leave, including miscarriage and stillbirth support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave salary top-up of up to 80%, as well as a personalized return-to-work transition and accommodation plan for full-time employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A generous product discount!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;Toronto, Ontario&lt;br&gt;60 Bloor Street W&lt;br&gt;Hybrid; 3 days in office 2 days remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;65-79K&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Mejuri we embrace a hybrid working environment and support our corporate employees to be successful whether they are at home or in the office. The primary purpose of our offices is to drive collaboration and deepen relationships with one another.This position requires in office work 3 days a week and remote work 2 days a week. Our office is located at 60 Bloor Street W, Toronto.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Mejuri, we use AI-assisted tools as part of our recruitment process to help screen and assess candidate applications. All hiring decisions involve human review, and our Talent team remains responsible for evaluating candidates and making final decisions throughout the process.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Mejuri our success is driven by a strong commitment to our Purpose and Values. They&#39;re the foundation of our operations, defining how we show up, solve problems, and accomplish incredible things—together.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our strength comes from each team member&#39;s dedication to embracing and embodying these Values daily. This isn&#39;t merely a duty; it&#39;s a passion that defines us. They guide us in providing extraordinary experiences for our customers and fostering an innovative environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Success, for us, means living our values relentlessly.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our values are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RAISE THE BAR&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;| Stay Curious, Share/Seek Feedback, and Strive for Excellence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CUSTOMER OBSESSED&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;| Get close to the customer and prioritize them in our decisions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EMPOWERED OWNERS |&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Treat the company like your own, take initiative&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FIND A WAY |&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Seek simple, creative solutions, and act fast&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DRIVE RESULTS&lt;/strong&gt; | Be clear on your goals and be relentless in achieving them&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TEAM FIRST&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;| Value team success over personal ego&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodation / Accessibility:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mejuri does not discriminate in hiring or terms and conditions of employment because of an individual’s race, ancestry, colour, place of origin, religion, gender, gender identity, national origin, citizenship, age, disability, sexual orientation, family status or marital status, or any other protected category recognized by provincial or federal laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Should you require any accommodation, please inform us and we will work with you to meet your accessibility needs. For any accessibility-related assistance, requests for information in accessible alternative formats or to report any accessibility problems, please share in your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
